# Reusable Components

- Shared primitives live in `src/components/ui/`
- Feature components compose from `ui/` — no duplicate button/form patterns
- Each UI component: typed props, `'use client'` only when needed, exported via barrel `index.ts`
- Page files stay thin; content lives in `*Content` components (e.g. `LandingContent`)
- Do not inline MUI button/form markup in pages when a `ui/` primitive exists

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD — thin page
export default function HomePage() {
  return <LandingContent initialHealth={initialHealth} />;
}

// ❌ BAD — duplicated button styling in a page file
<Button sx={{ backgroundColor: '...' }}>Submit</Button>
```
